OL,3,GNEWSAMeals on wheels delivery service
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner has praised the meals on
OL,7,Fwheels service that delivers to her
OL,8,Ffive days per week.
OL,10,FDot Rogers, from Woking, says she has
OL,11,Fbeen receiving deliveries from the
OL,12,Fcouncil-run community meals delivery
OL,13,Fservice "for many years".
OL,15,F"The food is always really hot, and
OL,16,Fthat I appreciate," she told BBC Radio
OL,17,FSurrey. "I wrap my sweet in a towel
OL,18,Fwhile I have my befores, and then I go
OL,19,Fon to that."
